_paragraph\" >\u2764 <i>Master a deep and dynamic combat system</i> to generate high Love scores and become the Cupid of death!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610650/extras/63ddda39f02de34127c79a56ffcd858a.poster.avif?t=1772788077\" width=600 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610650/extras/63ddda39f02de34127c79a56ffcd858a.webm?t=1772788077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610650/extras/63ddda39f02de34127c79a56ffcd858a.mp4?t=1772788077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2764 Destroy shareholder value! </i>Mining corp <i>Tigris Nix</i> wants to drain your world of <i>The Love</i>, a natural force keeping your planet alive. Lay waste to its robot drones to heal <i>the Oasis</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2764 Kill \u2018em with kindness! </i>Every point of damage dealt against a robot is one piece of The Love released back into the environment and one step closer to the end of Tigris Nix.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610650/extras/d0d5c3a784bddd9742724bf4cfca18be.poster.avif?t=1772788077\" width=600 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610650/extras/d0d5c3a784bddd9742724bf4cfca18be.webm?t=1772788077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610650/extras/d0d5c3a784bddd9742724bf4cfca18be.mp4?t=1772788077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2764 <i>Dazzle your enemies </i>by decorating your arms and guns with fabrics and ornaments. Add butterflies to your barrel, paint yourself in pink chrome, and \u2013 yes \u2013 dominate the battlefield in a quintuple-denim masterpiece.</p>","developers":["Funny Fintan Softworks"],"dlc":[4331780],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610650/11e6cbc668994dee390e0fa00bf065c7d1c586b0/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1772788077","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Don't Stop, Girlypop! \u00a9 2026 Funny Fintan Softworks Pty. Ltd.. All rights reserved. Developed by Funny Fintan Softworks Pty. Ltd., and exclusively licensed to Kwalee Ltd. Kwalee is a trademark of Kwalee Ltd. All other trademarks and logos are the property of their respective owners.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFunny Fintan Softworks acknowledges the Traditional Owners of Country throughout Australia and the Whadjuk Nyoongar land on which it is built. <br />\r\nWe pay our respects to Elders past, present and emerging.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2610650/1090226085/c34be6ad8c5629e388523c3e3b58d456daf4fd6e/1772457368/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772458841","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2610650/1090226085/c34be6ad8c5629e388523c3e3b58d456daf4fd6e/1772457368/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772458841","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2610650/1090226085/c34be6ad8c5629e388523c3e3b58d456daf4fd6e/1772457368/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772458841","id":257274481,"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://sha